      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Greg, Thanks.\n1. Do you mean the **class_find_device_by_devt** API(which calls **device_match_devt**) is not allowed to be used in device driver? And it is because we may have risk using it to access the **device** owned by another driver?\n\n2. **tty_register_device** and **tty_buffer_space_avail** are functions accessing the device owned by the driver itself, are they allowed to be used?",
      "parentUuid": "a77b0fd6_8477b4c7",
      "revId": "47f13b319dd921f60f78d005c33e58bade5bc03b",
